# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Exploring Latent Representations for Human Mesh Recovery
#
# Nothing generated by a training run, an evaluation or a figure script belongs
# in version control. Checkpoints, datasets and rendered frames are reproduced
# from the code and the configs; see docs/REPRODUCE.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

